      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[prefetch D04321E7AF26F2040A653B5955294DC481F61C8E.dmg sha1:D04321E7AF26F2040A653B5955294DC481F61C8E size:77600264 https://download.mozilla.org/?product=thunderbird-45.5.1-SSL&os=osx&lang=en-US sha256:702C09D4939C9DA3165032627EDB2E46F0E5E5C606DBBC39EE067FE066DE03DF

